{"title":"hello sun shadow tomato plant","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/hello-sun-shadow-tomato-plant","date":1780150477000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e194148c-af59-4df9-8656-8b828de686aa/tomato2.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e194148c-af59-4df9-8656-8b828de686aa/tomato2.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e194148c-af59-4df9-8656-8b828de686aa/tomato2.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e194148c-af59-4df9-8656-8b828de686aa/tomato2.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e194148c-af59-4df9-8656-8b828de686aa/tomato2.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e194148c-af59-4df9-8656-8b828de686aa/tomato2.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e194148c-af59-4df9-8656-8b828de686aa/tomato2.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e194148c-af59-4df9-8656-8b828de686aa/tomato2.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p>more from my <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">sketchbook</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n \n\n\n  <p>hello there. I’ve been absent here for a few months, while leading two long group containers — (<a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/labyrinth\">labyrinth</a> and <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/digital-abundance\">digital abundance</a>) — traveling to and from US cities where old friends and family live, and watching the uncertainties of my life tangle and untangle, hanging itself on a tiny thread. my body has been reacting with nausea and dread — while my mind remains: the relentless investigator, asking insistent, circular questions, seeking solutions, uncomprehending, parasitic, and desperate. this is okay. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d3ee23ca-497d-4d4d-9efe-f5be1a305bd5/tomato6.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d3ee23ca-497d-4d4d-9efe-f5be1a305bd5/tomato6.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d3ee23ca-497d-4d4d-9efe-f5be1a305bd5/tomato6.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d3ee23ca-497d-4d4d-9efe-f5be1a305bd5/tomato6.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d3ee23ca-497d-4d4d-9efe-f5be1a305bd5/tomato6.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d3ee23ca-497d-4d4d-9efe-f5be1a305bd5/tomato6.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d3ee23ca-497d-4d4d-9efe-f5be1a305bd5/tomato6.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d3ee23ca-497d-4d4d-9efe-f5be1a305bd5/tomato6.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n \n\n\n  <p>when in doubt, I seek the places of sun and shadow. I traced the leaf outline of my mother’s tomato plants last week, while sitting in my parents’ terrace. I noticed the wind blowing the leaves, and how they danced on the page. that was all, there was nothing else to say. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e877fce5-16ac-4775-805e-7ce5f38bab24/tomato7.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"2926\" height=\"2292\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e877fce5-16ac-4775-805e-7ce5f38bab24/tomato7.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e877fce5-16ac-4775-805e-7ce5f38bab24/tomato7.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e877fce5-16ac-4775-805e-7ce5f38bab24/tomato7.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e877fce5-16ac-4775-805e-7ce5f38bab24/tomato7.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e877fce5-16ac-4775-805e-7ce5f38bab24/tomato7.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e877fce5-16ac-4775-805e-7ce5f38bab24/tomato7.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e877fce5-16ac-4775-805e-7ce5f38bab24/tomato7.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n \n\n\n  <p>I’ve made an immense amount of work the last months, even if most of it has been in my private teaching containers. I’m backlogged — on creative life metabolizing, on writing letters, on my podcast, on all the incubating projects and offerings that have been wanting to take shape. </p><p>there is too much to say — to tell you, my dear void. I’ve missed this place. I think I’ll begin again, with just sharing one thing a day. hopefully, this will release some of the heaviness and suffocation I’m feeling. or, at least, allow it move. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f0138ddf-1b91-46f2-9e49-c243199ccfe4/tomato4.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f0138ddf-1b91-46f2-9e49-c243199ccfe4/tomato4.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4